          "_name": "features16",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features15\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>About&nbsp;</b><b><br></b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><br>Serving the California Central Coast Since 1990<br><br>Certified Professional Point of Sale Programmer &amp; Installer<br>Computer Tutor &amp; Tech Support Specialist<br>Graphic, Web &amp; Logo Designer<br><br>\"A Real Person Providing Real Help\"<br><br>Two traits have been with me my entire life: helping people, and fixing things. Combined with a stubborn insistence on doing honest, good quality work, that's basically the whole business plan<br><br>Long before I was a certified POS programmer, I spent decades in restaurants themselves — working in, managing, and owning restaurants, bars, nightclubs, and 5-star fine dining establishments, starting back in high school. That background is still the backbone of what I do today: I currently program and support a fine dining restaurant's full seven-course menu, wine pairings, hold &amp; fire timing, and modifiers for every scenario imaginable — the kind of setup that only makes sense if you've actually worked a floor, not just installed a terminal<br><br>I started learning computers way back in the early days of Macs and PCs. My first computer was a Mac with an 9-inch screen and&nbsp;128 KB  of RAM. In those days you could start a print job, have lunch, take a walk on the beach, and come back to find only half the page had printed — with plenty of time left to wait for the rest<br><br>We've come a long way since then. Everything's fast and instant now, but with everyone stretched thin just trying to keep up, it seemed natural to help however I could — and that's how Beacon Computer Solutions began in 1990<br><br><i>Chuck Siler</i><br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/hpim0071-border-545x688.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
